            {"op": "mul", "args": [0.8, {"op": "sub", "args": [1, {"var": "attempted"}]}]},
            {
              "op": "add",
              "args": [
                {"op": "mul", "args": [0.5, {"var": "last_gain"}]},
                {"op": "mul", "args": [-0.6, {"var": "stagnation"}]}
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "branches": 2
  },
  "predicted_decision_change": "Next generation will rank rag and tools (failure_rate 0.667, attempted 0, stagnation 0) above recovery (failure_rate 0.667, attempted 1, stagnation 1) and memory (failure_rate 0.333, attempted 1, last_gain 0.238). The two branches will likely target rag and tools/prompt instead of recovery, shifting exploration toward unattempted high-failure modules while still allowing memory to compete via its last_gain bonus."
}

